sequenceDiagram
  participant P as Phone
  participant S as CarConnectionService
  participant R as Room (trips + reminders)
  participant N as Notifications
  participant W as Glance widget

  P->>S: CarConnection → PROJECTION connect
  S->>R: startTrip()
  S->>N: "Add reminder?" (connect channel)
  P->>S: CarConnection → disconnect
  S->>R: endTrip() + pending reminders
  S->>N: pending reminders (disconnect channel)
  S-->>W: connected state + pending count
